    {
      "title_cn": "8 张 eMudhra 证书遭泄露，Cloudflare 发布更新",
      "title_en": "8 eMudhra certificates compromised, Cloudflare issues updates",
      "title_original": "8 eMudhra certificates are compromised. Here's what you need to know",
      "source": "Cloudflare Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-10-20T22:20:16.524000+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/emudhra-certificate-compromise/",
      "category": "internet",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "2026年10月19日约17:00 UTC，Cloudflare 获悉 8 张 eMudhra 中间证书的私钥遭泄露。由于密钥较弱，攻击者可伪造任意域名的证书以拦截或篡改流量。Cloudflare 已为 Cloudflare One Clients（WARP/1.1.1.1 应用）和 Cloudflare Tunnel（cloudflared）发布更新，并在 CDN 部署缓解措施；其审查未发现 Cloudflare 服务被实际利用。",
      "what_happened_en": "On October 19, 2026, around 17:00 UTC, Cloudflare learned that private keys for 8 eMudhra intermediate certificates were compromised. Because the keys are weak, an attacker can forge a certificate for any domain to intercept or modify traffic. Cloudflare released updates for Cloudflare One Clients (WARP/1.1.1.1 app) and Cloudflare Tunnel (cloudflared) and deployed CDN mitigations; its review found no active exploitation on Cloudflare services.",
      "why_it_matters": "这些证书被浏览器和操作系统广泛信任，伪造证书可能让攻击者冒充服务器并拦截或篡改互联网流量。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "These certificates were widely trusted by browsers and operating systems, so forged certificates could let attackers impersonate servers and intercept or modify Internet traffic.",
      "importance_score": 82,
      "supply_level": 1,
      "section": "explore",
